---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content'

const next = (await getCollection('next', (next) => !next.data.draft))[0]
const { Content } = await next.render()
---

<section class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-4 py-4">
    <div class="max-w-screen-lg sm:text-lg">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl text-orange-800 font-extrabold md:text-4xl dark:text-orange-200">
        Monthly Meetings
      </h2>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        Every month, we hold two meetings. The first meeting covers a range of topics including
        Health, Aged Care, Travel, Technology, Retirement services, etc.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        After some refreshments, our second meeting at 12:30pm covers financial and investment
        topics including Superannuation, Retirement income, Investment Markets, Financial Trends,
        etc.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 font-bold dark:text-gray-300">
        If you are retired or approaching retirement, come along, meet new friends and receive
        useful information to help your retirement.
      </p>
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl text-gray-900 font-bold tracking-tight dark:text-white">
        Next Meeting: {next.data.title}
      </h2>
      <section class="lg:prose-xl mx-auto max-w-screen-lg prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert">
        <Content />
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
